# Regenerates the greeting prewarm list when it drifts from the shipped
# greetings, installs it into the shim's volume and re-prewarms through
# POST /prewarm — no restart, no caller waiting 1.8 s. Quiet when in sync.
# Install to /etc/cron.d/prewarm-watch (root:root 0644); the script goes to
# /usr/local/sbin/prewarm-watch.sh (root:root 0755).
*/5 * * * * root /usr/local/sbin/prewarm-watch.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
